      <p begin="0:13.500" end="0:16.800" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1 v2"><span begin="0:13.500" end="0:16.800">Watch how I let it all unfold</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:15.200" end="0:16.800"><span begin="0:15.200" end="0:16.800">(일라)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(快苏醒吧)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">illa</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">且看我如何让万物全数破晓</span></p>
